      "candidateMethodology": "All 676 file units and all 676 official NARA OCR transcripts were screened. The 95 entries retain 66 direct Volume XXX review folders and 29 cross-volume folders. The presidential-conversation lane promotes only economically signaled Scowcroft folders and requires matching each conversation to the Bush Library Memcons and Telcons index before selection. The full ledger preserves all parallel Meeting Files, Gates notes, Special Separate copy sets, schedules, call logs, and media files without silently duplicating them. PDF byte size is measured only where the server returned Content-Length; file-unit page counts were not measured in this collection-wide pass. Opening citation sheets support FRUS-style provenance stems, but all candidates remain archival locators until the individual heading, dateline, terminal classification, release status, and exact document extent are checked in the source images.",
