      "methodology": "Every file unit was enumerated from the complete NARA Catalog series hierarchy. Catalog coverage dates normally control the working chronology; seven signed directives or annexes without usable Catalog dates use dates documented on withdrawal sheets or an action profile. NARA extracted text supplies high-level and economic-policy review signals for every online PDF. Routing reflects manual review of every title, full OCR transcript, opening provenance marker, and withdrawal-sheet description. Marker status requires the opening OCR segment to name the record group, office, series, subseries, and folder. Thirteen handwritten Folder ID corrections, nine opening-marker-to-Catalog ID mismatches, and two file units without online PDFs are retained explicitly.",
      "statusLabel": "H-Files National Security Directive series",
